ing of life itself?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Note from the developer:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is inspired by &quot;Getting Over It with Bennett Foddy&quot;, itself a homage to an older game made by Jazzuo. I aimed to capture the magic of GOI's intensely difficult gameplay, which becomes comically easy once you master it.</p>",
